      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1377639998,
      "text": "Melocanna baccifera is one of two bamboo species belonging to the genus Melocanna. It grows up to 10–25 m tall. It is native to Bangladesh, Myanmar, India, and Thailand."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Melocanna baccifera",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melocanna_baccifera",
